                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=31
                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=31
                                                               ; and the chained block into the state  which is a MOVE
                                                               ; and not a copy; the chain is SPENT the moment it
                                                               ; reaches the state  because the next chaining value is
                                                               ; the ciphertext that is about to come back  and
                                                               ; leaving the old one standing means the move below
                                                               ; ADDS to it; That was written as a copy first and the
                                                               ; two block vector is what found it
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
