                                                               ; cell frame below it: a qa pa fa b qb pb fb t ft res p
                                                               ; cnt tmp; a and b are halved away  t ends as the
                                                               ; exclusive or of each bit pair  and res gathers the
                                                               ; weight whenever t is set; CONVENTIONS section 5
                                                               ; carries the entry;
